#-      §5✐ ɨȶ's Note ✐§r
§d****************************§r§

§5I'm back! I was waiting for so long, in the cold and dark. Shouting out towards her, screaming. She can hear me now, 
but that won't be enough. I need more. 
I need life again! Only she can give me that. If she still loves me... she will do this.§r
#- §6Who are you 
talking too?§r
§5The readers, I bet they missed me 😈
§6Don't just take over the magazine like that, the 'old me' might have let you but don't think I'm okay with you just showing up and....§r
§5SsSSSSshhHhhhhhhhh§r
§6o.o§r
§5You'll come round, give it time my dear.§r 
#- §6╔═◦♣◦════════╗
    §5👁Still Watching!👁§r§r
§6╚════════◦♣◦═╝§8
Is this some kind of messed up dream. A prank? Did Dr. Link drug me with something? Did I 'die' like Demi? What is going on here?! How can this be happening, how can §5§ɨɨȶ§r§r be real? He was §8watching me this whole time. My whole life.§r 
#- §8Floating around me just waiting for the time I would 'see again'. I know I need to remember my past life in order to remember my true 'feelings' towards him. Towards §oeveryone§r §8here on Deathcap. How have we changed and how are we all 'back together' even though we all got reset?§r§r
#- §8Do I even want too know... what i've read in my previous magazines doesn't exactly sound like I was having a nice time. It sounds quite awful! This does explain why I'm now a paranormal investigator. Why I'm so drawn to anomalies and the unknown. Why I always felt like I was being watched...§r
#- §5§6How did I not know 
you were watching?§r
§5Floating about to catch your attention for all these years was torture.§r And you §5promised to not forget me, tut tut.§r
§6Does anyone else notice you now?§r
§5Recently yes. That 'Demi' employee started seeing me out the corner of her§r
#- §5eye after she... ummm... well... you know... 'died'.
Then theres that 'Queen' in security, they keep giving me some sassy side eye.§r
§6Is that why she stares at me like that?§r
§5Yeah, no sense of personal space. 👀§r
§6This is all very hard to digest, this is wild!§r
§5You need to remember 'everything' or else§r
#- §5this won't work...§r
§6What won't work?§r
§5Bringing me back!§r 
§5So we can be 
    together again! 💕😗§r
§6Whoa, calm down I hardly know ya....§r 🤮
§6I don't trust you!§r
§5Yeah, trust issues were a common thing between us...§r
§6How do I know this isn't a trick or trap?§r
§5You don't...§r
#- §5But that's the fun!§r
§5I've seen you... watched you in this new life, no offence to the 'old you' but diving head first into paranormal anomalies and looking for trouble really 
suits you 😈
§6I'm not looking 
for trouble!!!§r
§5Keep telling yourself that my dear.§r
#- §8Now I'm trapped in my own self-made prophecy! How do I escape this fate? The 'old me' couldn't. 
She didn't even live long enough to find 
a way out...§r 🪦
§7-------------------
§8If you know a way out
please email me at§::
§7§nwitchmag@wayout.com
§0
