#-  §d╔═--═ஓ๑🍄๑ஓ═--═╗§r
      §5   Choices!§r
 §d╚═--═ஓ๑🍄๑ஓ═--═╝§r

§dDear Diary,
I've been thinking...
§5Good for you!§
 🤭
§6Shut up... 😒§r
§dI've been thinking about what my life really means, it only repeats, and always ends with me, and §5ɨȶ§r, §dand§r The Darkness.§r
#- §dAnd the same group of people. Sure, we gather a few new friends along the way, or enemies, or both, but what is the point 
if nothing changes?§r 

§5It's far too early in the season for you 
to start having your depressive episodes my dear... §r
§6Can you blame me??§r
#- §dThe 'old me' wished for a better life, away from the horror, and she got that wish in the form of me. I feel like I owe her. Or should repay her or something. It's not fair! I owe her some answers. I owe her the truth, whatever that is.§r §6Maybe finding out who YOU are?§r 
                      §5o.O
#- §dIf I want to uncover the truth, then I need friends in high places. And I use the term 'friends' lightly. Not much is known about 'Soulcorp'. This factory pouring out black smoke, the nature dying around it, the distant cries in the cracks of it's cold walls. I've heard 
some stories though...§r
#- §5Me and Soulcorp... have a history. Do you want me to find out if those stories are true? I can do it you know! I'd do 'almost' anything for you....§r
§6Get out of my magazine and out of my head! Be quiet! 😭
§5Soulcorp can help us, Enocori could help us bring me back and give you answers...§  😈
#- §dSo I've been thinking, about looking into things I should not. Taking a peek behind the curtain that is Deathcap. I'm good at being unseen. Just like our many ghosts here I can use my magic to pass by without notice. Even this magazine will be protected. They can read it but they won't remember much.§r
#- §dSometimes difficult choices need to be made in order to move forward. This is me putting my foot down! This is me... moving forward! I refuse to be stuck on repeat! Never again! This is the 'new' me. This is 
my purpose...§r 
      §6to stop the loop.§r 
§5Now you're 
talking my language!§r
#-   §5ɨȶ's§r§r §2Song Request!§r§r
