§8+====+ §9Ask A Witch?
-------------------
§3Welcome to Witch-Craft Magazines Advice Column! Here is what you do... Have any paranormal questions for the Deathcap Team? Send in your questions right here!§r 
#- §9✉ Reader Demi
-------------------
There's been a dark figure wondering around Deathcap. I've seen it as I sleep at the office. It's creepy as it's just a figure and it's always looking up at the offices, 
but I've noticed it 
also looking at 
your tavern.
-------------------§r
#- §6ლ(ಠ益ಠ)ლ§r
§5It wasn't me! At least, 
I don't think so... might have been... hard to tell.§r ¯\_(ツ)_/¯
§6§3Okay okay... umm...§r
§3Thank you for sending in this information Demi. This will be past on to the Team. I'm sure we can 'figure' it out... no pun intended. Wait... you sleep in your office???§r§r
#- §9✉ Reader Unknown
-------------------
Did ja miss me? muahahaha
-------------------§r
§3Umm.. no. I don't know who you are therefore I have not missed you. But your tone is giving me negative vibes and I'm going to sage myself now. Thank you for your message.§r
#- §9✉ Reader Unknown
-------------------
Careful Star - tread lightly for the gods are §4watching§r
§9-------------------§r§r
§3This is an Advice Column. Please leave your godly concerns and possible threats with the security team.
§5Queen is a god right?
§6o.O§r
§5Just saying...§r§r§r
#- §9✉ Reader Unknown
-------------------§r
§5ɨȶ§r §9is watching...§r
§9-------------------§r
§5Again... not me!§r
§6Would you like some advice anyway?§r
§5I think I'm getting some not matter what I....§r
§6If you really love someone, you should tell them everything. You should not hide your true self.§r
#- §5Not that simple...§r
§6But it is that simple, just tell me who you are. You waited so long last time that it was too late. She... I mean... I was so close! I changed you for the better, made you more than just an 'ancient evil entity' inside a book. Why continue hiding? If you want my help, you'll tell me.§r
#- §9『••✎••』§r

§3Need your questions answered or some witchy advice? 

Submit your question;
§7§nwitchmag@clueless.com§r§r
§3for a chance to be
featured!§r
 
