#- §4❎ §4𝗖𝗼𝗻𝗳𝗶𝗱𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗮𝗹 𝗗𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁 ❎
§8-------------------
𝗧𝘆𝗽𝗲:
𝗛𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗪𝗿𝗶𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗻 𝗟𝗲𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗿

𝗖𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗻𝘁:
𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝗖𝗘𝗢 𝗢𝗳 𝗦𝗼𝘂𝗹𝗰𝗼𝗿𝗽,
𝘁𝗼 𝗮𝗻 '𝗼𝗹𝗱 𝗳𝗿𝗶𝗲𝗻𝗱'.

𝗣𝗼𝗶𝗻𝘁'𝘀 𝗢𝗳 𝗜𝗻𝘁𝗲𝗿𝗲𝘀𝘁:
𝗧𝗲𝗺𝗽𝗹𝗲 𝗮𝗻𝗱 𝗨𝘀𝗲 𝗢𝗳 𝗦𝗼𝘂𝗹𝘀.
-------------------
§cGuest Written 
By Enocori 🖉 
#- §6Wait! We can't read this can we?§r
§5Why not... you wanted secrets, I got you secrets... and the best part is... SOULS, 
clue is in the name!§r
§6What if it's 
something bad, or...§r
§5THAT IS THE POINT!§r
§6I know... but it's wrong.§r
§5You must be tempted?§r
§5Come on... peek behind that curtain...§r 😈
#- §8Dear old friend,

It's all underway and going just as we planned, the §oartefact§r §8is once again in our possession and transported near to the source well.
We've come so far with everything, not just this, but all of our progress and I know we are close now!§r§r
#- §8We won't fail this time! Not again. 
That... §othing§r, it has no §8power over us anymore. We control it. We demand it's obediance not them. 
So much power is at our fingertips just barely out of reach, teasing us, laughing at us from the void, but we have it to control nonetheless.§r§r
#- §8Well I say we do, damn thing hasn't even hatched yet. We keep §ofunneling souls§r into 
§8it but nothing. Who knows, maybe your eyesight wasn't the best that day... 
My translations may have been rusty. All I know is it has taken far more than just §oone soul§r to unlock 
§8it's potential...§r
#- §8I truly wish we knew what to do. Maybe then you would still be here with us...

After your sacrifice, the rest of the team left. Some left quietly and most made it clear how felt about this.

But understand, no one misses you more than I do, truly.§r
#- §8One can't dwell 
in the past... 

I don't even know why I still write these letters. Maybe I'm hoping you will just... walk into my office 
one day.

But I promise, I will finish what we first set out to do in that dreadful temple!§r
#- §6That's... well... 
some heavy stuff. 😢§r
§6They lost a friend for some artefact... 
and for knowledge? Power maybe?§  Humm... 
§5I'm more interested in  "§8We keep funneling souls into it but nothing§5" There is your proof they know how to deal with souls!
§6Show some compassion.§r
§5I'm lifeless my dear...§r
#- §6Well what do you want me to do about this!?§r
§5I want you to take your pretty little face and walk into that Soulcorp factory that just so happens to be right across the river and talk to someone about getting souls for me!§r ... Please.
§6'Pretty little face'... 😒§r
§5I'm thinking Enocori 
is our best bet!§r
#- §5Also "§8more than just one soul to unlock 
it's potential§5" you should keep that in mind cause the same applies with me. 😎
§6§lNOT SAID YES YET!!§
§

§5But you will go, right?§r§r
§6Yes... yes I'll go.§r
§5Perfect! Team work!§r
§6Betraying everyone.§r
§5For the truth.§  Do this... and you'll find out 
who I really am...§r 💀 
